99
00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:43.610
That was it the beginning, two weeks later.

100
00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:46.570
It's like you had something bursting inside of you.

101
00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:47.403
Yeah.

102
00:03:47.403 --> 00:03:49.430
