111
00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:06.950
I'm like, "Oh, I'm getting that money.", right?

112
00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:09.660
So I dressed up, I had my security guard,

113
00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:12.710
