125
00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:40.470
like, and I said, I was a pimp, I had a cane.

126
00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:43.370
They brought me a suit, a tie and it was incredible.

127
00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:44.340
So we walked around.

128
00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:46.950
So, he walked by me four times.

129
00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:48.360
He did not know it was me.

130
00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:50.530
And then finally, I had to walk up to him.

131
00:04:50.530 --> 00:04:53.830
I said, "Prince" and he just looked at me, he goes,

132
00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:57.000
and he just fell, he was literally laying on the floor

133
00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:58.330
on his back laughing.

134
00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:00.192
And I got that money. (bangs table)

135
00:05:00.192 --> 00:05:02.010
(Drew and audience cheering)

136
